'''Flow Like the Stream (Merciless)''' is an [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] that was added in [[Version 9.2 Update|Version 9.2]] and appears on the '''13th''', '''14th''', '''27th''', and '''28th''' of every month. When clearing this stage, there is a chance to unlock [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Teacher BearCat]]. Unlike most Advent Stages, it is unlocked after clearing Chapter 2 of [[Into the Future]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

