'''Difficulty:''' ★★★★☆

'''Battle:''' Start spamming Manic Mohawk Cat and Cat Cactus instantly, as they near-permastall Scissoroo, allowing you to completely max out your wallet. Beyond that point, it's just spamming Fishman, Jelly Dumpling, and Can Can Cat off cooldown to get consistent chip damage on the major threats. Tourist Cat can push back Kappy Jr. incredibly well during periods of downtime. Your primary concern should be timing Macho Crystal Cats, as their crowd-control is invaluable when it comes to regaining ground and isolating Scissoroos. This strategy will leave you with a surplus of cash, which should be viewed as reserves specifically for spamming Cyborg Cats in moments of dire straits. It will be a long back and forth, so play adaptively and don't let up.

