==Trivia==
*Bottom of the Swamp's Japanese name, Honogurai Numa no Soko Kara (ほの暗い沼の底から, "From the Bottom of the Dark Swamp"), is a reference to ''Honogurai Mizu no Soko Kara'' (仄暗い水の底から, "From the Bottom of the Dark Waters"), the Japanese name of the horror movie ''[[wikipedia:Dark Water (2002 film)|Dark Water]]''.
*Flow Like the Stream's Japanese name, Kawa no Nagare no Yō ni (河の流れのように, "Like the Flow of the River"), is also the name of a [https://youtu.be/_JPKop-dYJ8 song] by [[wikipedia:Hibari Misora|Hibari Misora]], except the stage name spells ''kawa'' (river) with the kanji 河 instead of 川.

